        effects: [{ t: 'renown', amount: 2 }, { t: 'gold', amount: -8, memo: 'Tribute on imagined souls' }, { t: 'favor', amount: 1 }],
        reply: 'Counted generously. I have included a pilgrim who passed through in Seedtide, and his donkey, as a household.',
